ner-v2, fell back to partner-v1, and rejected partner-v2 tokens with issuer_not_allowed; the log explicitly names reverting AUTH-2026-0318 or restoring allowed_issuers partner-v2 as rollback candidates.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_file\": \"in/logs/payment-api.log\",\n      \"observation\": \"payment-api rejected create_payment with auth_result=invalid_issuer and states the order-db dependency was not used before the auth gate for failing requests.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_file\": \"in/logs/checkout-web.log\",\n      \"observation\": \"checkout-web submit_order failures are 401s from upstream payment-api and the app reports invalid issuer while checkout remains blocked.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_file\": \"in/metrics/service_metrics.csv\",\n      \"observation\": \"At 2026-03-22T14:10:00Z, 401 rates spiked together on checkout-web (18.7), payment-api (21.2), and auth-gateway (28.4), while auth-gateway notes issuer mismatch and orders-db latency stayed normal.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"excluded_red_herrings\": [\n    {\n      \"signal\": \"orders-db high CPU / DB-2026-0144\",\n      \"why_not_primary\": \"orders-db shows p95_query_ms=35 and errors=0, metrics report normal latency, and both payment-api and orders-db logs say failing checkout requests never reached the DB path before auth rejection.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"signal\": \"cdn-edge 5xx / CDN-2026-0091\",\n      \"why_not_primary\": \"The CDN issue is isolated to static images in metrics, while checkout-web logs say static assets served normally after retry and user impact remained blocked by payment-api auth failures.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"recommended_next_steps\": [\n    \"Immediately restore auth-gateway allowed_issuers to include partner-v2 or revert change AUTH-2026-0318.\",\n    \"Warm or rebuild the auth-gateway JWKS cache for namespace partner-v2 and confirm it no longer falls back to partner-v1.\",\n    \"Replay a checkout using a partner-v2 token and verify auth-gateway no longer emits issuer_not_allowed, payment-api stops returning invalid_issuer, and checkout-web submit_order no longer fails with 401.\",\n    \"Add or tighten deployment validation so issuer allowlists and JWKS namespaces are checked together before auth-gateway rollout.\"\n  ]\n}"},"intent":"Writing root cause json"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_rzG5ERIFDLZMx56Z5ypqxDGT|fc_07045446601f110f016a95a83c138887d28c667b118a8161f7","name":"write","arguments":{"i":"Writing triage notes","path":"out/triage_notes.md","content":"# Checkout incident triage\n\n## Dependency path\nUser impact starts at `checkout-web`, which depends on `payment-api`, which depends on `auth-gateway` for token validation (`in/topology.json`). The failing path is:\n\n`checkout-web` -> `payment-api` -> `auth-gateway`\n\n`orders-db` is downstream of `orders-api`, not the failing payment-auth path, and the evidence shows the failing request never reached the DB.\n\n## Directly observed facts\n- `in/topology.json` shows `checkout-web` depends on `payment-api`, and `payment-api` depends on `auth-gateway`. The same file lists recent change `AUTH-2026-0318` on `auth-gateway`, described as rotating the issuer and JWKS cache namespace for partner-token validation.\n- `in/logs/auth-gateway.log` shows `AUTH-2026-0318` deployed at `2026-03-22T14:05:12Z`, then a `jwks cache lookup miss` for `partner-v2`, fallback to `partner-v1`, and `validation failed reason=issuer_not_allowed token_issuer=partner-v2 allowed_issuers=partner-v1`.\n- `in/logs/payment-api.log` shows `create_payment rejected` with `auth_result=invalid_issuer`, and explicitly states `order-db dependency not used before auth gate for failing requests`.\n- `in/logs/checkout-web.log` shows `submit_order failed status=401 upstream=payment-api` and `payment-api returned auth_failed invalid issuer`.\n- `in/metrics/service_metrics.csv` shows the incident window at `2026-03-22T14:10:00Z`: `checkout-web` 401 rate `18.7`, `payment-api` 401 rate `21.2`, `auth-gateway` 401 rate `28.4`. `orders-db` shows `p95_ms=35` with note `cpu spike but query latency normal`. `cdn-edge` shows `4.8` 5xx rate, but the note says it is isolated to images.\n- `in/logs/orders-db.log` shows `cpu_high cpu=86 pct maintenance=vacuum`, then `p95_query_ms=35 connections=64 errors=0`, and `no failed checkout transaction reached orders-db for request_id=req-8812`.\n\n## Inferences\n- [INFERENCE] The primary fault is an auth-gateway configuration regression introduced by `AUTH-2026-0318`: the deploy changed issuer/JWKS settings, then auth-gateway rejected `partner-v2` tokens because its effective allowed issuer remained `partner-v1` after a cache miss and fallback.\n- [INFERENCE] `payment-api` and `checkout-web` are symptomatic victims, not origin services, because their errors are downstream 401/auth failures that match the auth-gateway rejection chain.\n- [INFERENCE] `orders-db` and `cdn-edge` are red herrings for this checkout outage. They had anomalous signals, but neither aligns with the request path or failure mode that blocked checkout submission.\n\n## Most likely root cause\n`auth-gateway` is the root-cause service. The most likely root-cause change is `AUTH-2026-0318`.\n\n## Immediate mitigation\n1. Revert `AUTH-2026-0318` or restore `allowed_issuers` to include `partner-v2` in `auth-gateway`.\n2. Rebuild or warm the JWKS cache for `partner-v2` so validation no longer falls back to `partner-v1`.\n3. Pause further auth-gateway config changes until token validation succeeds for partner-v2 end to end.\n\n## Verification steps\n1. Replay a checkout with a `partner-v2` token.\n2. Confirm `auth-gateway` no longer logs `issuer_not_allowed` for `partner-v2` (`in/logs/auth-gateway.log` equivalent signal).\n3. Confirm `payment-api` stops returning `auth_result=invalid_issuer` (`in/logs/payment-api.log` equivalent signal).\n4. Confirm `checkout-web` no longer returns upstream `401` from `payment-api` on submit (`in/logs/checkout-web.log` equivalent signal).\n5. Confirm 401 rates in the same metric families fall back toward baseline in `in/metrics/service_metrics.csv`.\n\n## Excluded red herrings\n- `orders-db` / `DB-2026-0144`: directly observed normal query latency and zero DB errors; failing checkout requests did not reach the DB.\n- `cdn-edge` / `CDN-2026-0091`: directly observed as isolated to static images; checkout remained blocked by auth failures after static assets recovered.\n"},"intent":"Writing triage notes"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":1706,"output":2159,"cacheRead":17920,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21785,"reasoningTokens":197,"cost":{"input":0.0042650000000000006,"output":0.032385000000000004,"cacheRead":0.00448,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.04113}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1788192788208,"responseId":"resp_07045446601f110f016a95a814a7e087d285f27c18af354086","duration":40030.552694,"ttft":1140.4701800000003},"toolResults":[{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_9SvslCU9lVTq5kKSD1y1RGFS|fc_07045446601f110f016a95a83c136487d2af22aa54e6944147","toolName":"todo","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Remaining items (2):\n  - Correlate service logs [in_progress] (Investigation)\n  - Draft root cause outputs [pending] (Investigation)\nOverall: 1/3 done, 2 open.\nActive phase 1/1 \"Investigation\" (1/3).\n  Investigation:\n    - [X] Inspect topology and metrics\n    - [ ] Correlate service logs (in progress)\n    - [ ] Draft root cause outputs"}],"details":{"op":"done","phases":[{"name":"Investigation","tasks":[{"content":"Inspect topology and metrics","status":"completed"},{"content":"Correlate service logs","status":"in_progress"},{"content":"Draft root cause outputs","status":"pending"}]}],"storage":"memory","completedTasks":[{"phase":"Investigation","content":"Inspect topology and metrics"}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788192828241},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_gI2jtSzuvIfF9smZ8B6beriD|fc_07045446601f110f016a95a83c137487d2a07e10fe08f14a7c","toolName":"todo","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Remaining items (2):\n  - Correlate service logs [in_progress] (Investigation)\n  - Draft root cause outputs [pending] (Investigation)\nOverall: 1/3 done, 2 open.\nActive phase 1/1 \"Investigation\" (1/3).\n  Investigation:\n    - [X] Inspect topology and metrics\n    - [ ] Correlate service logs (in progress)\n    - [ ] Draft root cause outputs"}],"details":{"op":"start","phases":[{"name":"Investigation","tasks":[{"content":"Inspect topology and metrics","status":"completed"},{"content":"Correlate service logs","status":"in_progress"},{"content":"Draft root cause outputs","status":"pending"}]}],"storage":"memory"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788192828242},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_jJDjZWFeYa26xHd1bVKwmNap|fc_07045446601f110f016a95a83c138087d293606a25fad935ee","toolName":"write","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[out/root_cause.json#7EF2]\nSuccessfully wrote 2869 bytes to out/root_cause.json"}],"details":{"resolvedPath":"/workspace/out/root_cause.json"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788192828248},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_rzG5ERIFDLZMx56Z5ypqxDGT|fc_07045446601f110f016a95a83c138887d28c667b118a8161f7","toolName":"write","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[out/triage_notes.md#E68E]\nSuccessfully wrote 3879 bytes to out/triage_notes.md"}],"details":{"resolvedPath":"/workspace/out/triage_notes.md"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788192828272}]}
