{"type":"message_update","assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"text_end","contentIndex":1,"content":"Done.\n\nCreated:\n- `out/root_cause.json`\n- `out/triage_notes.md`\n\nChecks:\n- Verified `out/root_cause.json` contains the required top-level fields, evidence list, excluded red herrings, and next steps.\n- Verified `out/triage_notes.md` includes the dependency path, cites 5 fixture files by path, separates directly observed facts from `[INFERENCE]`, and lists mitigation plus verification steps.\n\nRoot conclusion:\n- Root-cause service: `auth-gateway`\n- Root-cause change: `AUTH-2026-0318`\n- Confidence: `high`\n\nPrimary evidence chain:\n- `in/topology.json` links `checkout-web -> payment-api -> auth-gateway` and lists `AUTH-2026-0318`.\n- `in/logs/auth-gateway.log` shows deploy, JWKS cache miss, fallback to `partner-v1`, and `issuer_not_allowed` for `partner-v2`.\n- `in/logs/payment-api.log` shows `invalid_issuer` rejection before DB use.\n- `in/logs/checkout-web.log` shows user-facing 401s from `payment-api`.\n- `in/metrics/service_metrics.csv` shows aligned 401 spikes on the same path.\n\nExcluded red herrings:\n- `orders-db`: high CPU, but normal latency/errors and failing request never reached DB.\n- `cdn-edge`: isolated image 5xxs, not the checkout auth failure path."}}
